WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:02.062
Section 5.

00:00:02.012 --> 00:00:04.125
The Layoff Massacre.

00:00:04.125 --> 00:00:11.637
While subsidies flow upward to corporate headquarters, the journalists themselves are being discarded like spent ammunition.

00:00:11.637 --> 00:00:16.087
We have lost hundreds of local news outlets since 2008.
